midtraining-distillation
========================

This repository is a derivative work. It combines modified code from three
upstream projects with original contributions.


1. Meta Platforms, Inc. — lingua
--------------------------------
https://github.com/facebookresearch/lingua
Licensed BSD-3-Clause. Copyright 2024 Meta. Full text in LICENSE.

The `lingua/` package and `apps/main/` are derived from lingua. Modifications:

  * `apps/main/train.py` — added two knowledge-distillation losses
    (forward KL, and switch distillation: a teacher-entropy partition
    between cross-entropy and reverse KL) plus their dispatch, the
    per-token entropy/quantile machinery, KD diagnostics, and an OLMES
    evaluation hook. Roughly 40 further loss variants were developed here
    and removed before release.
  * `lingua/data.py` — `DataArgs` extended with the KD configuration fields;
    dataloader extended to carry precomputed teacher signals.
  * `lingua/probe.py` — activation probes (upstream), retained because
    `lingua/transformer.py` calls into it on the forward path.
  * `setup/`, `scripts/`, `apps/main/eval_olmes.py`, `apps/main/configs/` —
    new in this work.

Unmodified upstream files retain their original copyright notices.


2. Allen Institute for AI — open-instruct
-----------------------------------------
https://github.com/allenai/open-instruct
Licensed Apache-2.0.

Not redistributed, and no patch against it is distributed. Our runs used
commit 63834749cbd3119666f40931d41a41fcffed4972 with local modifications that
adapt open-instruct to plain Slurm and local checkpoints rather than Ai2's
Beaker infrastructure; those modifications are described, but not shipped, in
`post_training/README.md`. The Slurm scripts in `post_training/scripts/` are
original to this work.


3. Allen Institute for AI — olmes / oe-eval
-------------------------------------------
https://github.com/allenai/olmes
Licensed Apache-2.0.

Not redistributed, and no patch against it is distributed. Our runs used
commit c8194ffe7d6b2f7c694a3d5073d382dd01447f30 with local modifications
(GSM-Plus and GSM-Symbolic task configurations, a corrected GSM8K answer
extractor, and `exact_match_flex` as the primary metric for
`minerva_math_500::tulu`); those are described, but not shipped, in
`evaluation/README.md`. The scorers in `evaluation/scripts/` are original to
this work.


